.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH label 1  "label " 
.SH NAME
label \- Add, remove, or list user labels (free\-text tags) on an item. A label is user vocabulary, distinct from the plugin\*(Aqs display type; filter `list`/`next` with `\-\-label`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlabel\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add, remove, or list user labels (free\-text tags) on an item. A label is user vocabulary, distinct from the plugin\*(Aqs display type; filter `list`/`next` with `\-\-label`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
label\-add(1)
Attach a label to an item (idempotent). The label is trimmed; a blank label is rejected
.TP
label\-remove(1)
Detach a label from an item (observed\-remove)
.TP
label\-list(1)
List an item\*(Aqs labels (sorted)
.TP
label\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
